Modifications made for this distribution
----------------------------------------
Source: this fork. The patches are in patches/ and are applied to the
upstream commit named below — nothing is patched at runtime.

  01-linux-runtime.patch     restores the Linux runtime behaviour that
                             upstream removed from the desktop client and
                             adds the "unofficial build" line plus a link to
                             the packager's repository to the About window.
  02-flatpak-runtime.patch   Flatpak-specific system-menu and Linux backend
                             integration.

The upstream tag and commit each release is built from are recorded in the
Flatpak manifest (flatpak/io.github.nichu42.wire-desktop-linux.yml) and in
the AppImage build workflow (.github/workflows/build-linux.yml).

Bundled third-party components keep their own licences
------------------------------------------------------
The Electron and Chromium notices ship inside the application directory as
LICENSE.electron.txt and LICENSES.chromium.html. Flatpak build-time and
runtime dependencies install their own licences under /app/share/licenses/
(see share/licenses/<app-id>/ for the licences of this package itself).
